</style>
<h2>Asobi Review 1.0 (build 935)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>The cheat sheet (H) is complete.</b> Every viewer key and every menu shortcut, in three columns — a second cap on a row is the menu's chord for the same thing, which works while a text field has focus. Mouse gestures, the loop range, files and review, settings and the license are all there.</li>
<li><b>The PDF cheat sheets fill their page</b> and open with "Start here": six things a newcomer needs — opening a shot, playing and stepping, the color helper for a picture that looks wrong, marking up, notes, and where help is. The Expert sheet gained Home/End, N, - / = and the mouse.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
